484
00:32:43,666 --> 00:32:45,958
Aku ingin memberitahumu sesuatu.

485
00:32:46,041 --> 00:32:51,291
Hampir terjadi, tapi aku menahannya

486
00:32:51,375 --> 00:32:55,208
karena tubuhku suci

487
00:32:55,291 --> 00:32:58,000
dan vaginaku adalah taman rahasia.

488
00:32:58,083 --> 00:33:01,125
Aku Jillothene Shaw,

489
00:33:01,208 --> 00:33:06,791
