penakluk iblis seksual yang maha kuasa!

490
00:33:06,875 --> 00:33:08,875
Aku Jill!

491
00:33:11,000 --> 00:33:12,958
Dompetku ketinggalan.

492
00:33:15,333 --> 00:33:16,291
Tolong.

493
00:33:18,625 --> 00:33:22,083
Aku bersumpah tak mendengar apa pun.

494
00:33:22,166 --> 00:33:23,208
Astaga.

495
00:33:24,041 --> 00:33:26,333
Tapi aku punya satu pertanyaan.

496
00:33:28,708 --> 00:33:31,375
Apa maksud "taman rahasia"?

497
00:33:33,416 --> 00:33:34,666
Sialan.

498
00:33:37,083 --> 00:33:38,208
Dompetku ketinggalan.

499
00:33:38,291 --> 00:33:40,708
- Tidak! Jill, tidak!
- Astaga.

500
00:33:40,791 --> 00:33:43,666
Astaga, kunci pintumu, Jill.

501
00:33:43,750 --> 00:33:45,333
Kau tak mengunci pintu?

502
00:33:45,416 --> 00:33:48,666
- Aku bersumpah tak mendengar apa pun.
- Astaga.

503
00:33:55,250 --> 00:33:59,375
Mereka mungkin
sedang bercinta sekarang. Pasti.

504
00:34:00,666 --> 00:34:02,000
Ya, terserah.

505
00:34:06,291 --> 00:34:08,000
Mungkin giginya jelek.

506
00:34:14,041 --> 00:34:14,875
Tak ada pesan.

507
00:34:17,000 --> 00:34:18,000
Baiklah.

508
00:34:18,666 --> 00:34:22,250
Jangan gila. Kau gila.

509
00:34:22,333 --> 00:34:24,958
Para Wanita, hindari sakit hati.

510
00:34:25,041 --> 00:34:29,916
Jika dia tak mengirimimu pesan,
dia tak mau bicara denganmu.

511
00:34:30,000 --> 00:34:32,958
Kebenaran itu penting. Kita harus…

512
00:34:33,041 --> 00:34:33,875
Apa?

513
00:34:39,875 --> 00:34:41,458
Cek.

514
00:35:15,625 --> 00:35:16,666
Selamat malam, Izzy.

515
00:35:16,750 --> 00:35:18,125
PONSEL, 11 AGUSTUS 2025

516
00:35:18,208 --> 00:35:19,416
Selamat malam, Bro.

517
00:35:19,500 --> 00:35:20,583
Aku mencintaimu.

518
00:35:22,041 --> 00:35:23,500
Aku juga.

519
00:35:25,541 --> 00:35:29,291
Kau tahu sebagai pendamping pria,
kau harus berpidato, 'kan?

520
00:35:30,750 --> 00:35:31,625
Dia tak tahu.

521
00:35:31,708 --> 00:35:33,583
- Ayolah. Aku tahu.
- Tak tahu.

522
00:35:33,666 --> 00:35:35,458
Kalian meremehkanku.

523
00:35:35,541 --> 00:35:38,958
Tidak. Kami sangat menghargaimu,
tapi aku harus menulisnya.

524
00:35:39,041 --> 00:35:41,500
Dan setelah banyak pertimbangan…

525
00:35:41,583 --> 00:35:43,500
- Ya?
- …kau boleh bawa pasangan.

526
00:35:43,583 --> 00:35:44,833
- Ya!
- Tapi…

527
00:35:44,916 --> 00:35:49,500
Kau tak boleh membawa pemengaruh
yang tak kau ketahui nama aslinya.

528
00:35:49,583 --> 00:35:50,708
Aku tahu namanya.

529
00:35:50,791 --> 00:35:52,708
- Tidak.
- Sama sekali.

530
00:35:52,791 --> 00:35:54,583
Kalian bicara soal Lu, 'kan?

531
00:35:54,666 --> 00:35:55,958
Lonestar Lu?

532
